{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Am nevoie de o secțiune Shopify (Liquid section) pentru un banner hero complet customizabil, optimizată pentru traduceri (compatibilă cu Shopify Translate & Adapt, Localize etc.).
    
    CERINȚE GENERALE:
    - Toate textele (titlu, subtitlu, CTA) trebuie să fie definite în schema și să suporte traducere (nu hardcoded).
    - Cod curat, modern, fără dependențe externe.
    
    LAYOUT:
    - Secțiunea trebuie să fie centrată și să aibă un MAX-WIDTH de 1300px pe desktop.
    - Conținutul NU trebuie să fie full-width.
    - Pe mobile poate fi full width (edge-to-edge).
    - Containerul trebuie să fie centrat cu margin: 0 auto.
    
    IMAGINI:
    - 2 image pickers separate:
      - imagine desktop
      - imagine mobile
    - Responsive logic:
      - desktop image pentru >768px
      - mobile image pentru <=768px
    
    TEXT:
    - Titlu
    - Subtitlu
    - CTA text
    - CTA link
    
    CONTROL AVANSAT (FOARTE IMPORTANT):
    
    LAYOUT:
    - poziție text (left / center / right)
    - aliniere verticală (top / center / bottom)
    - max width pentru content (slider)
    - spacing (padding top/bottom)
    
    TIPOGRAFIE:
    - font size separat pentru:
      - titlu (desktop + mobile)
      - subtitlu (desktop + mobile)
      - CTA (desktop + mobile)
    - font weight
    - line height
    
    CULORI:
    - culoare titlu
    - culoare subtitlu
    - culoare CTA
    - culoare background buton
    - culoare hover buton
    
    OVERLAY:
    - overlay activ/inactiv
    - culoare overlay
    - opacitate overlay (range slider)
    
    BUTON:
    - stil buton:
      - outline
      - solid
    - border radius
    - padding
    
    ALTE DETALII:
    - opțiune pentru gradient overlay (jos sau lateral)
    - suport pentru text shadow (on/off)
    - border radius pentru banner
    - hover subtle effect (zoom imagine sau fade)
    
    RESPONSIVE:
    - layout optimizat pentru mobile
    - control separat pentru poziționare text pe mobile
    
    STRUCTURĂ:
    - folosește best practices Shopify sections
    - include `{% schema %}` complet
    - cod semantic și performant
    
    SCOP:
    Vreau o secțiune premium, flexibilă, reutilizabilă pentru homepage sau category banners, cu control granular și compatibilitate perfectă cu multi-language.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-hero-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.banner_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1300px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: {{ block.settings.spacing_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.spacing_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 400px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: {{ block.settings.vertical_alignment }};
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.text_position }};
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.banner_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.6s ease;
  }

  {% if block.settings.hover_effect == 'zoom' %}
    .ai-hero-banner__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-hero-banner__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-hero-banner__image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    {% if block.settings.overlay_enabled %}
      {% if block.settings.overlay_gradient == 'bottom' %}
        background: linear-gradient(to top, {{ block.settings.overlay_color }}, transparent);
      {% elsif block.settings.overlay_gradient == 'left' %}
        background: linear-gradient(to right, {{ block.settings.overlay_color }}, transparent);
      {% elsif block.settings.overlay_gradient == 'right' %}
        background: linear-gradient(to left, {{ block.settings.overlay_color }}, transparent);
      {% else %}
        background-color: {{ block.settings.overlay_color }};
      {% endif %}
      opacity: {{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.content_max_width }}px;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_position }};
    {% if block.settings.text_shadow_enabled %}
      text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.line_height }};
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size_desktop }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.line_height }};
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.cta_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_weight }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    {% if block.settings.button_style == 'solid' %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.cta_color }};
      border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    {% else %}
      background-color: transparent;
      color: {{ block.settings.cta_color }};
      border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.cta_color }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-hero-banner__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    {% if block.settings.button_style == 'solid' %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }};
      border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }};
    {% else %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }};
      border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.hover_effect == 'fade' %}
      opacity: 0.8;
    {% endif %}
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-hero-banner__image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.spacing_top | times: 0.6 }}px 0 {{ block.settings.spacing_bottom | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: 300px;
      justify-content: {{ block.settings.text_position_mobile }};
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 30px 16px;
      text-align: {{ block.settings.text_position_mobile }};
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .ai-hero-banner__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.cta_size_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-hero-banner-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-hero-banner__wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-hero-banner__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.image_desktop %}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.width }}"
          height="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.height }}"
          class="ai-hero-banner__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-hero-banner__image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-hero-banner__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.image_mobile %}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.image_mobile | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.width }}"
          height="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.height }}"
          class="ai-hero-banner__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-hero-banner__image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
      {% endif %}

      <div class="ai-hero-banner__overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

      <div class="ai-hero-banner__content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-hero-banner__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.title }}</h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.subtitle != blank %}
          <p class="ai-hero-banner__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subtitle }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.cta_text != blank and block.settings.cta_link != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.cta_link }}" class="ai-hero-banner__cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.cta_text }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

